              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 7:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Rwoth uwacu kumae, Kum dhanu maeni eoro ceng’ni i vuta man giyunga ku dhoggi man ku dendhoggi, ento gicoro adundegi bor kuda, man lworo migi ma gilwora ko en e lembang’ola mi dhanu ma juponjogi ko; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 1:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno, nen, abibetimo tic ma wang’uijo i kind dhanu maeni, en e tic ma wang’uijo ku musana; e rieko mi jurieko migi birwinyo, man ng’eyong’ec mi dhanu migi ma riu bipandre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can wi ju m’upanu lembapora migi thuth ni Yehova, man ma tic migi ni i mudho, m’uwacu de kumae, Ng’a m’unenowa? man ng’a m’ung’eyowa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 45:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 9:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuloko wi piny piny mire! Jubifoyo ulobo calu jacwiagulu; ma nia gin ma jucwio uwac ni ng’atu m’utime kumae, Icwia ngo; kadi gin ma jung’ino uwac ni ng’atu m’ung’ine kumae, Ng’eyong’ec pare mbe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En e nindo ma nyanok dit ungo, man jubidwoko Lebanon ni podho ma cek hai, podho ma cek hai ke jubiwacu ya luli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E i ceng’ maeca ju m’udhing’ biwinjo lembe mi kitabu, man ju ma abinga bineno kud i ka ma col man kud i mudho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ju ma mol bende binyayu mutoro migi i Yehova, man anyong’a binego jucan ma kind dhanu ni kum Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum judwoko ng’atu mi ndiri ni gin mananu, e jacac uthum, man jukabu dhanu ceke m’ukio kier cen; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma dwoko dhanu ni jadubo i lembe pare, man ma ketho uwic ni ng’atu m’ujuko i dhugang’ de, man ma loko won bedopwe cen ku gin mananu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Yehova wacu kumae, m’uwaru Ibrahim, pi ot pa Yakobo: Kawono lewic binego Yakobo ngo, kadok wang’e de bilokre kawono ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kinde m’eneno nyithindhe, ma tic mi cinga, i kinde, e gibidwoko nyinga leng’; eyo, gibidwoko Ng’atu Maleng’ pa Yakobo leng’, man gibilworo Mungu mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ju m’ukier i tipo bende gibitundo ba ng’eyong’ec, man ju m’ung’ur bijolo ponji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
